  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Runs the title until a game or the demo starts. Then sets the game IRQ values and fills the status line."},
    {"at":13,"placement":"side","text":"Cave A and demo_mode are the defaults of the title."},
    {"at":29,"placement":"side","text":"Copies the raster split values of the game."},
    {"at":53,"placement":"side","text":"The demo always plays cave A at level 1."},
    {"at":64,"placement":"side","text":"Digit 3: three lives in the status line."},
    {"at":91,"placement":"side","text":"Status line text for the routine at $6b16."},
    {"at":102,"placement":"side","text":"Ends the cave before it starts. The cave setup clears it."},
    {"at":107,"placement":"line","text":"Colours of the border and of the background registers 0-3 on the title, for $d020-$d024."},
    {"at":112,"placement":"line","text":"Raster split values of the title: two bytes each for $d011, $d016, $d018 and $d012, copied to $54-$5b."},
    {"at":120,"placement":"line","text":"Raster split values of the game: two bytes each for $d011, $d016, $d018 and $d012, copied to $54-$5b."},
    {"at":128,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the title colours, draws the title scene, puts the IRQ into title mode, waits for its first frame and clears the sound state."},
    {"at":134,"placement":"side","text":"Screen $0800, charset $2000."},
    {"at":155,"placement":"side","text":"Text pointer to $db01: colour RAM up to $dc00 becomes white."},
    {"at":176,"placement":"side","text":"Draws the title scene: TTSCEN in the symbol table leftover."}
  ],
